- Example 21: the $## of scenario (d) is no longer a workaround for the
  defect, and the example without it gives the right output on the C++
  backend; but it took 88.7 s against 2.6 s with the operator, and the
  Python backend exceeded 2 GB in scenario (d).  A narrowed variable costs
  inside a capsule: every choice of its generator, and of the generators
  of its parts, escapes when the question needs it, one split and one
